	(text "DRV8353S external parts (SLVSDY6A Table 21, Fig. 63):\nC18 VM 0.1 uF VM-rated (bulk on Power sheet provides >= 10 uF)\nC19 VCP to VDRAIN 1 uF 16 V+     C20 CPH-CPL 47 nF VDRAIN-rated\nC21 VGLS 1 uF 16 V+     C22 DVDD 1 uF 6.3 V+     C23 VREF 0.1 uF\nR6 nFAULT 10k, R7 SDO 1k pull-ups to 3.3 V (open drain, Fig. 63).\nInternal: nSCS 50k pull-up to DVDD (5 V): MCU pin must be FT (PB7).\nENABLE, INHx/INLx, SCLK, SDI have 100k pull-downs: bridge off in MCU reset.\nVDRAIN: route to the high-side MOSFET drains. VREF = MCU 3.3 V (ratiometric ADC).\nIdle = all INHx/INLx low (ENABLE low = sleep, registers reset)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
